  "We envision a future where every Kenyan student has the opportunity to pursue international education, supported by expert guidance and tailored solutions that enable them to thrive academically and professionally on a global scale.": "Tunaona mustakabali ambapo kila mwanafunzi wa Kenya ana fursa ya kufuata elimu ya kimataifa, akisaidiwa na mwongozo wa kitaalamu na suluhisho zilizoundwa mahususi zinazomwezesha kufanikiwa kitaaluma na kikazi katika kiwango cha kimataifa.",
  "What we stand for": "Tunachosimamia",
  "The three promises behind every application we handle, from your first visit to your visa.": "Ahadi tatu zilizo nyuma ya kila ombi tunalolishughulikia, kuanzia ziara yako ya kwanza hadi visa yako.",
  "INSIDE STUDIES & AWARDS": "NDANI YA STUDIES & AWARDS",
  "One office. Every department you’ll need.": "Ofisi moja. Kila idara utakayohitaji.",
  "From IELTS training to visa compliance, it's all handled in the same Eldoret office. Your file doesn't get handed between agencies.": "Kuanzia mafunzo ya IELTS hadi utiifu wa visa, yote hushughulikiwa katika ofisi ile ile ya Eldoret. Faili yako haitupwi kati ya mashirika tofauti.",
  "Meet the whole team": "Kutana na timu nzima",
  "Director": "Mkurugenzi",
  "Partnerships, strategy and anything that needs senior attention.": "Ushirikiano, mkakati na jambo lolote linalohitaji umakini wa juu.",
  "Director’s PA Team": "Timu ya Msaidizi wa Mkurugenzi",
  "Reaching the Director, and following up on her behalf.": "Kumfikia Mkurugenzi, na kufuatilia kwa niaba yake.",
  "Application Team": "Timu ya Maombi",
  "Preparing and submitting your applications abroad, including GTE preparation and assessments.": "Kuandaa na kuwasilisha maombi yako ughaibuni, ikiwemo maandalizi na tathmini za GTE.",
  "Preparing and organising the documents your application needs.": "Kuandaa na kupanga nyaraka ambazo ombi lako linahitaji.",
  "Verification & Compliance": "Uthibitishaji na Utiifu",
  "Checking your documents before they go to institutions and visa authorities.": "Kukagua nyaraka zako kabla hazijaenda kwa taasisi na mamlaka za visa.",
  "Guiding you through your visa application.": "Kukuongoza katika ombi lako la visa.",
  "The GSR part of your application.": "Sehemu ya GSR ya ombi lako.",
  "Accounts": "Hesabu",
  "Payments, fees and other accounts questions.": "Malipo, ada na maswali mengine ya hesabu.",
  "Administration": "Utawala",
  "Masomo Welfare, Magister Sacco and the day-to-day running of the office.": "Masomo Welfare, Magister Sacco na uendeshaji wa kila siku wa ofisi.",
  "Language Preparation": "Maandalizi ya Lugha",
  "IELTS and PTE classes, and learning German.": "Madarasa ya IELTS na PTE, na kujifunza Kijerumani.",
