  "Canisius Yego is the Compliance and Verification Manager at Studies and Awards Limited, leading the team that reviews student documentation before it’s submitted to partner institutions and visa authorities.": "Canisius Yego ni Meneja wa Uzingatiaji na Uthibitishaji wa Studies and Awards Limited, anayeongoza timu inayokagua nyaraka za wanafunzi kabla hazijawasilishwa kwa taasisi washirika na mamlaka za visa.",
  "His focus is on accuracy and accountability: making sure every file is complete, verified and compliant, so students’ applications go out right the first time.": "Lengo lake ni usahihi na uwajibikaji: kuhakikisha kila faili ni kamili, imethibitishwa na inazingatia sheria, ili maombi ya wanafunzi yatumwe sawasawa mara ya kwanza.",
  "Dennis handles compliance and verification at Studies and Awards Limited, making sure every application meets the right standards.": "Dennis anashughulikia uzingatiaji na uthibitishaji katika Studies and Awards Limited, akihakikisha kila ombi linatimiza viwango sahihi.",
  "Dennis works in Verification and Compliance at Studies and Awards Limited, reviewing student documentation before it’s submitted to partner institutions and visa authorities.": "Dennis anafanya kazi katika Uthibitishaji na Uzingatiaji wa Studies and Awards Limited, akikagua nyaraka za wanafunzi kabla hazijawasilishwa kwa taasisi washirika na mamlaka za visa.",
  "His work is about catching errors and missing paperwork early, so applications go out complete and accurate the first time.": "Kazi yake ni kukamata makosa na karatasi zilizokosekana mapema, ili maombi yatumwe yakiwa kamili na sahihi mara ya kwanza.",
