  "Collins works on Masomo Welfare at Studies and Awards Limited, supporting students’ wellbeing throughout their time working with the company.": "Collins anafanya kazi kwenye Masomo Welfare katika Studies and Awards Limited, akiunga mkono ustawi wa wanafunzi katika muda wote wa kufanya kazi na kampuni.",
