  "Witney is the IELTS and PTE Tutor at Studies and Awards Limited, preparing students for the English-language tests most destinations require before they can enrol.": "Witney ni Mkufunzi wa IELTS na PTE wa Studies and Awards Limited, akiwaandaa wanafunzi kwa mitihani ya Kiingereza ambayo nchi nyingi huhitaji kabla ya kujiandikisha.",
