  "Karen is the German Language Tutor at Studies and Awards Limited, teaching German to students who are preparing to study in Germany.": "Karen ni Mkufunzi wa Lugha ya Kijerumani wa Studies and Awards Limited, akifundisha Kijerumani kwa wanafunzi wanaojiandaa kusoma Ujerumani.",
  "She also guides students on Germany as a destination, so she is the person to ask about studying there as well as about learning the language.": "Pia huwaongoza wanafunzi kuhusu Ujerumani kama nchi ya kusoma, kwa hiyo ndiye mtu wa kuuliza kuhusu kusoma huko na pia kujifunza lugha.",
